      "quote": "Studies were only included if they meet the following inclusion criteria: (1) prospective RCTs, (2) comparing surgical treatment against non-surgical, clinical management of flail chest injury. ... Studies that included any non-flail or nontraumatic rib fractures were excluded. Any studies including individuals aged < 18 years were also excluded.",
