      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e4",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_9",
      "quote": "comparing surgical treatment against non-surgical, clinical management of flail chest injury",
      "reason": "The synthesis groups (surgical vs non-surgical management) are specified and directly correspond to the comparison defined in the review objective, as also reflected in the outcome tables (surgical group vs non-surgical group)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No rationale is provided for notable eligibility restrictions such as excluding observational studies, letters, conference papers, and case reports; the only rationale given ('To minimise retrieval and publication bias') relates to the absence of language/date limits, not to the restrictions themselves."
